Birinchi bosh komponent qaysi yo'nalish?
A) Dispersiya eng katta yo'nalish
B) Birinchi belgi ustuni
C) Dispersiya eng kichik yo'nalish
ANSWER: A

PCA qaysi turdagi usul?
A) Nazoratli tasniflash
B) O'lchovni kamaytirish (nazoratsiz)
C) Regressiya
ANSWER: B

explained_variance_ratio_ nimani ko'rsatadi?
A) Har komponent tushuntirgan dispersiya ulushini
B) Model aniqligini
C) Belgilar sonini
ANSWER: A
